WEBVTT

00:42.542 --> 00:45.962
SOLD OUT ON YOU

00:51.050 --> 00:51.926
Are you kidding me?

00:53.803 --> 00:54.888
I'll give you one each day.

00:54.971 --> 00:57.348
-What do you think you're doing?
-Ms. Dam.

00:58.683 --> 00:59.976
Let's meet every day.

01:05.732 --> 01:08.151
DEOKCHEON REST AREA

01:10.737 --> 01:16.076
I mean, why would I…
receive my meds from you?

01:19.537 --> 01:23.833
Our materials make up 90%
of L'Étoile's La Fin Essence.

01:23.917 --> 01:24.834
That means

01:24.918 --> 01:28.088
90% of Gojeuneok Bio's fate
depends on L'Étoile's product launch.

01:28.630 --> 01:29.964
I can't let

01:30.548 --> 01:33.843
the home shopping host's condition risk
such an important broadcast.

01:33.927 --> 01:35.804
Wait, hold on.

01:35.887 --> 01:37.722
Did you just say "broadcast"?

01:41.684 --> 01:42.811
Wait…

02:02.080 --> 02:04.666
HOME SHOPPING BROADCAST
PARTNERSHIP AGREEMENT

02:07.919 --> 02:10.255
"As L'Étoile's La Fin Essence

02:10.338 --> 02:12.715
will be launched through a live broadcast,

02:12.799 --> 02:15.051
the parties under this agreement
are obligated

02:15.135 --> 02:18.596
to maintain and manage
the home shopping host's condition."

02:18.680 --> 02:22.433
"If any action is required, both parties
must work together to resolve the matter."

02:22.517 --> 02:25.478
Yes. One pack per day.

02:25.562 --> 02:28.690
That's the condition I'm requesting
for our contract renewal.

02:29.524 --> 02:30.608
Then…

02:31.276 --> 02:33.736
this means you're going to
supply the raw material?

02:33.820 --> 02:36.281
Yes, if both you and L'Étoile
accept my condition.

02:36.364 --> 02:38.283
Of course, we will!

02:38.366 --> 02:39.742
Of course!

02:46.499 --> 02:47.500
You can't take it back.

02:48.459 --> 02:50.170
Then, I'll see you tomorrow.

02:51.462 --> 02:52.672
Wait!

02:54.674 --> 02:56.509
Well…

02:56.593 --> 02:59.345
You still need to take care
of the current problem.

03:10.982 --> 03:12.150
It's all resolved now, right?

03:12.233 --> 03:13.860
Yes.

03:13.943 --> 03:15.528
Oh, right.

03:15.612 --> 03:19.616
I can take a cab, so don't worry.
You can head home now.

03:21.701 --> 03:23.202
Take care.

03:28.958 --> 03:30.501
Wait!

03:33.087 --> 03:34.380
I…

03:35.089 --> 03:36.215
187-2 SEONGCHO-DONG

03:36.299 --> 03:38.009
DEOKCHEON REST AREA
TO 187-2 SEONGCHO-DONG

03:38.092 --> 03:39.886
ESTIMATED TIME
2 HOURS 20 MINUTES

03:42.055 --> 03:45.475
Still, there's no traffic at this hour,
so it won't take long.

03:45.558 --> 03:46.935
It's not very close though.

03:47.018 --> 03:49.520
My nickname is "Dam Talk," you know.

03:49.604 --> 03:52.815
A couple hours will just fly by
if you're with me.

03:52.899 --> 03:55.652
My regular viewers even wait
until just before products sell out

03:55.735 --> 03:57.612
so I won't end the show early.

03:57.695 --> 03:58.947
Let's just go quietly.

03:59.030 --> 04:00.323
But that's not polite.

04:00.406 --> 04:02.450
I can't just sit by
while you drive long distance.

04:02.533 --> 04:04.911
I'd appreciate that.
That would be more helpful.

04:06.329 --> 04:07.330
All right.

04:23.763 --> 04:26.766
Just in case you might be thinking
that I can sleep well

04:26.849 --> 04:29.227
without my pills,

04:30.061 --> 04:32.647
I'm just keeping my eyes closed.

04:33.856 --> 04:36.484
I'm blocking out visual stimuli

04:36.567 --> 04:39.320
to trick my brain
into thinking I'm sleeping.

04:39.404 --> 04:41.239
You might actually sleep
if you don't talk.

04:43.741 --> 04:46.953
Geez, you're being quite harsh
to someone with insomnia.

04:47.036 --> 04:47.870
You heard that?

04:57.005 --> 04:59.340
How long have you been
taking sleeping pills for?

04:59.424 --> 05:01.259
It seems like it's been a long time.

05:03.594 --> 05:05.346
How would you know that?

05:20.153 --> 05:21.946
How did you know

05:22.030 --> 05:24.198
that I've been taking them
for a long time?

05:24.991 --> 05:27.744
I majored in chemistry.

05:28.369 --> 05:30.038
No wonder why.

05:30.121 --> 05:33.041
I knew you weren't the humanities type.

05:33.124 --> 05:34.417
Then, what's the STEM type like?

05:35.668 --> 05:37.211
The type who points out every detail.

05:38.421 --> 05:40.006
I can hardly say anything around you.

05:40.089 --> 05:42.592
Those pills suppress
the central nervous system,

05:42.675 --> 05:44.635
so you need to be careful
with long-term use.

05:45.636 --> 05:48.514
Are you showing off your expertise?

05:48.598 --> 05:52.351
Ms. Dam, the side effects
aren't something to take lightly either.

05:52.935 --> 05:54.812
Hallucinations, sleepwalking, and--

05:56.647 --> 06:00.526
I don't think there was a clause
allowing you to nag me.

06:00.610 --> 06:01.944
Give it. I'll add it then.

06:02.028 --> 06:04.280
No, we already made the deal,
so it's over.

06:04.363 --> 06:06.032
-Let me just add it.
-Don't be so cheap.

06:06.115 --> 06:08.034
-Give it to me.
-Focus on driving.

06:09.494 --> 06:10.745
Just kidding.

06:19.921 --> 06:20.922
We're here.

06:24.467 --> 06:25.468
Ms. Dam.

06:30.056 --> 06:31.349
Ms. Dam--

06:32.183 --> 06:33.392
What?

06:33.476 --> 06:34.435
We're here.

06:37.021 --> 06:38.314
I wasn't asleep.

06:38.898 --> 06:40.358
-Yes, you were.
-No, I wasn't.

06:40.983 --> 06:42.860
-I said you were.
-I said I wasn't asleep.

06:44.237 --> 06:46.489
You called my name like…

06:46.572 --> 06:49.158
-four times.
-It was three times. Get out.

06:54.122 --> 06:56.040
Oh, right. We…

06:57.667 --> 06:59.335
We should exchange numbers

06:59.418 --> 07:01.546
if we're going to meet
every day until the show.

07:06.300 --> 07:10.263
There's no need for that.
Let's pick a set time and place instead.

07:11.264 --> 07:12.181
AUGUST

07:12.265 --> 07:15.017
As you can see, I have no idea
where I'll be at any time.

07:22.024 --> 07:25.403
I won't contact you for any other reasons,
so just give me your number.

07:25.486 --> 07:26.529
Okay?

07:31.659 --> 07:34.454
Goodness, thank you so much.

07:44.213 --> 07:45.465
Could you open the door?

07:45.548 --> 07:47.633
-It's open.
-It is?

07:47.717 --> 07:49.135
You're right.

07:49.218 --> 07:50.386
But why isn't it working?

07:50.470 --> 07:52.138
It's not opening.

07:52.221 --> 07:54.223
Why are you so impatient?

07:55.266 --> 07:56.809
It opens if you push slowly.

08:08.321 --> 08:10.239
Get home safe then.

08:17.413 --> 08:20.458
Gosh, he startled me.

08:23.211 --> 08:25.421
MATTHEW

08:30.134 --> 08:33.429
MR. MECHOORI

08:38.684 --> 08:40.394
MR. MECHOORI

08:40.478 --> 08:41.646
BORN AND RAISED IN DEOKPUNG

08:44.315 --> 08:45.483
GOOD MORNING
HAVE A GREAT DAY

08:45.566 --> 08:46.817
What on earth?

08:46.901 --> 08:48.986
HAPPINESS COMES WITH THE RAIN

08:50.446 --> 08:52.114
I didn't think he'd be like this at all.

08:55.826 --> 08:56.661
This is awful.

08:57.328 --> 08:58.579
Oh, right!

09:18.599 --> 09:19.850
Sung-mi.

09:20.560 --> 09:22.353
How long have you been out here?

09:22.436 --> 09:25.189
You little…

09:25.273 --> 09:27.108
Where the hell have you been?

09:31.404 --> 09:32.947
For crying out loud.

09:34.156 --> 09:36.242
Have you lost your mind?

09:36.325 --> 09:38.619
You think whatever I say
is a joke, don't you?

09:38.703 --> 09:40.371
I clearly told you earlier

09:40.454 --> 09:42.498
to go home
and not do anything else but rest.

09:42.582 --> 09:46.210
I was going to give you some porridge,
but you weren't home and wouldn't pick up!

09:46.294 --> 09:47.962
Where on earth did you go?

09:48.045 --> 09:50.131
Why are you making such a fuss?

09:50.715 --> 09:52.758
I was away for just a few hours…

09:53.676 --> 09:55.219
I'm worried you'll burn out.

09:55.803 --> 09:57.179
Hey. They say even phones

09:57.263 --> 09:59.932
are at their strongest
when their batteries are at ten percent.

10:00.016 --> 10:01.225
Just like you!

10:04.145 --> 10:04.979
Sung-mi.

10:09.108 --> 10:11.068
Aren't you curious about who I met--

10:11.152 --> 10:12.820
No, I'm not.

10:13.571 --> 10:14.614
I'm sleeping over tonight.

10:14.697 --> 10:16.532
-What?
-We'll go to work together tomorrow.

10:16.616 --> 10:19.368
It was my fault for leaving you alone.

10:19.452 --> 10:20.578
I'm the one to blame.

10:20.661 --> 10:22.330
I'm totally fine though.

10:22.413 --> 10:23.456
Shut up!

10:24.957 --> 10:25.958
Yes, ma'am.

11:55.506 --> 11:56.715
Sung-mi.

11:58.426 --> 12:01.887
I experienced something really strange.

12:06.183 --> 12:08.811
Don't you have any upbeat music?

12:08.894 --> 12:11.272
This is music that helps plants relax.

12:15.609 --> 12:17.736
Is this a dentist's office or what?

12:44.597 --> 12:45.931
I felt relaxed.

12:46.640 --> 12:49.268
Was it because of the music?

12:50.644 --> 12:52.104
Or…

12:58.110 --> 12:59.445
Ms. Dam.

13:00.154 --> 13:01.363
Let's meet every day.

13:06.368 --> 13:08.120
I must be out of my mind.

13:08.204 --> 13:10.247
I must be crazy.

13:12.875 --> 13:14.877
GOJEUNEOK BIO

13:21.759 --> 13:23.093
-Oh, my gosh!
-Oh, my gosh!

13:23.677 --> 13:25.179
Where are you right now?

13:29.517 --> 13:30.518
You…

13:30.601 --> 13:31.810
Hey.

13:34.480 --> 13:36.565
Do you still have dreams
about the military?

13:37.191 --> 13:38.275
Was it a full night's rest?

13:38.359 --> 13:39.568
You're still not awake.

13:39.652 --> 13:41.904
Company, attention!

13:51.497 --> 13:52.748
I'm heading out.

13:52.831 --> 13:54.375
Hey, stay a bit longer.

13:54.458 --> 13:57.461
Let me feed you something.
How about a fancy restaurant?

13:58.128 --> 13:58.963
Hold on…

14:06.428 --> 14:07.972
Renewal?

14:09.640 --> 14:10.975
L'ÉTOILE
ERIC SEO

14:11.058 --> 14:12.851
You're renewing the contract?

14:23.612 --> 14:25.030
-Are you up now?
-Yeah.

14:25.114 --> 14:26.824
-Let me use some of your lotion.
-Sure.

14:38.168 --> 14:39.420
-Sung-mi.
-Yeah?

14:39.503 --> 14:41.380
How was I during the night?

14:42.172 --> 14:43.090
What do you mean?

14:43.173 --> 14:45.050
Well, I mean…

14:45.134 --> 14:46.427
Did I…

14:47.219 --> 14:48.304
toss and turn

14:48.929 --> 14:51.515
or talk in my sleep?

14:52.558 --> 14:55.060
Or did I walk around or anything?

14:55.769 --> 14:56.979
You slept like a log.

14:58.564 --> 14:59.899
Right?

15:00.858 --> 15:02.693
I knew it.

15:09.617 --> 15:11.035
I told you I'm heading to the farm.

15:11.118 --> 15:13.746
Just have one bite. Just one.

15:17.082 --> 15:18.042
Thank you for the food.

15:23.505 --> 15:24.715
I guess you like it.

15:25.424 --> 15:27.718
Have those rocks in your heart
dislodged now?

15:27.801 --> 15:29.887
You said I couldn't stop it
from happening anyway.

15:30.971 --> 15:32.306
Are you giving her the mushrooms?

15:35.809 --> 15:37.144
I think Ms. Dam

15:37.686 --> 15:38.687
is someone I can trust.

15:38.771 --> 15:39.772
Right.

15:42.900 --> 15:45.402
Were you with sweetie last night?

15:47.196 --> 15:48.530
What?

15:48.614 --> 15:51.283
I didn't see your car around this morning.

15:51.367 --> 15:53.535
I slept at the office.

15:53.619 --> 15:56.705
And stop trying to put
Ms. Dam and I together.

15:57.247 --> 15:59.291
I've treated you to a meal,

15:59.375 --> 16:02.169
so you'd better give me
a wedding invitation soon.

16:05.464 --> 16:06.632
Ma'am!

16:08.175 --> 16:09.176
Here, drink some water.

16:19.687 --> 16:21.605
FINALLY IN KOREA

16:22.189 --> 16:24.400
IN 9 DAYS

16:30.489 --> 16:32.908
A SINGLE MIRACULOUS DROP,
AMAZING SKIN TRANSFORMATION

16:38.205 --> 16:40.582
DAM YE-JIN'S ONLY1
L'ÉTOILE LA FIN ESSENCE

16:48.590 --> 16:52.011
Everything's great about this essence,

16:52.094 --> 16:53.429
except for this.

16:53.512 --> 16:55.180
There are some complaints about the pump.

16:55.264 --> 16:56.473
It leaks often,

16:56.557 --> 16:58.434
and many reviews say the suction is weak,

16:58.517 --> 17:00.602
so it won't work at all
once it's about half used.

17:01.186 --> 17:02.271
To be honest,

17:02.354 --> 17:05.065
I also switched it with a different pump
that fits the bottle.

17:07.526 --> 17:09.987
I think this is a pretty important issue.

17:10.070 --> 17:11.655
What do you think?

17:11.739 --> 17:13.741
You're not asking us
to switch the pumps, are you?

17:13.824 --> 17:15.409
Will it be possible?

17:16.035 --> 17:18.662
The pumps were made using a custom mold

17:18.746 --> 17:20.622
that reflects L'Étoile's identity.

17:20.706 --> 17:25.169
Does L'Étoile prioritize its identity
over customer convenience?

17:28.088 --> 17:29.631
Hang on.

17:29.715 --> 17:30.549
What?

17:32.342 --> 17:33.802
This isn't a one-time thing.

17:33.886 --> 17:35.721
So it's all okay
just because it's L'Étoile?

17:35.804 --> 17:37.181
Just hang on.

17:37.264 --> 17:39.683
So, Mr. Seo…

17:40.601 --> 17:44.396
Did you see the ads they put up
in the building on the way here?

17:45.105 --> 17:46.106
Yes.

17:46.190 --> 17:49.401
Then, you must have seen
my name in large font on them too.

17:49.485 --> 17:50.444
I did.

17:51.028 --> 17:52.571
Now that I have my name on it,

17:52.654 --> 17:55.199
disappointing customers
with L'Étoile products

17:55.282 --> 17:57.659
will be a blow to my pride.

17:59.870 --> 18:03.082
If you just switch the pumps,

18:03.999 --> 18:06.960
I really think I can introduce this
to everyone with confidence.

18:10.964 --> 18:12.591
We'll switch them.

18:12.674 --> 18:15.469
So please introduce it
as the perfect essence.

18:17.971 --> 18:19.807
Thank you so much, Mr. Seo.

18:26.814 --> 18:29.441
Where did you go
in such a hurry last night?

18:30.943 --> 18:32.069
I had something to do.

18:32.152 --> 18:33.112
At that late hour?

18:35.781 --> 18:36.907
By any chance,

18:37.658 --> 18:39.785
did you get any calls
from an unknown number?

18:39.868 --> 18:42.079
I always get calls from unknown numbers.

18:42.996 --> 18:46.708
From Jamie in the US,
from Mr. Kim guaranteeing high returns…

18:46.792 --> 18:48.293
Don't even get me started.

18:50.254 --> 18:53.590
Ms. Dam will contact you as well.

18:53.674 --> 18:54.967
I left her your number.

18:55.759 --> 18:57.261
Why?

18:57.344 --> 19:00.389
Did Ms. Dam ask for my number?

19:00.472 --> 19:01.348
Did her network say

19:01.431 --> 19:02.933
-they needed my help?
-No.

19:03.517 --> 19:06.520
Something came up,
so we have to communicate through you

19:06.603 --> 19:08.814
for about ten days
until the broadcast ends.

19:08.897 --> 19:10.816
Please tell me when she contacts you.

19:11.567 --> 19:12.568
Fine.

19:12.651 --> 19:14.820
Sorry for not telling you in advance.

19:14.903 --> 19:16.405
I'd appreciate the help.

19:17.948 --> 19:21.952
Well, you never tell me anything
in advance or apologize anyway…

19:22.870 --> 19:24.913
Mr. Park, aren't you going to work?

19:25.831 --> 19:27.499
There's only one shovel.

19:28.125 --> 19:29.710
We can't offer a discount,

19:29.793 --> 19:32.171
so we'll have to focus
on brand power this time.

19:32.254 --> 19:35.424
We can still emphasize that it's 15%
cheaper than ordering from overseas.

19:35.507 --> 19:37.634
-That's important.
-It is.

19:39.386 --> 19:42.097
Where did we put our list
of key selling points?

19:42.181 --> 19:43.557
My coffee tastes like essence.

19:43.640 --> 19:46.894
Let's have some snacks first
before continuing.

19:48.353 --> 19:51.148
As I said before,
we're going to have to communicate

19:51.231 --> 19:54.276
and follow up with the PR team
to promote the broadcast.

19:54.359 --> 19:56.695
WELCOME TO HIT HOMESHOPPING, L'ÉTOILE

19:56.778 --> 19:58.405
Do we have anything left on our agenda?

19:58.488 --> 20:00.115
Having delicious desserts?

20:09.041 --> 20:12.044
I'm sure you didn't return
just to give us desserts.

20:13.212 --> 20:15.005
What brings you here?

20:15.088 --> 20:16.006
I came to see you.

20:19.635 --> 20:21.595
I can't even joke around.

20:21.678 --> 20:22.846
I brought some news.

20:23.722 --> 20:26.141
I just met with our packaging supplier.

20:26.225 --> 20:29.353
We decided to start off
with 10,000 bottles for the launch at HIT.

20:30.062 --> 20:31.438
That's actually great news.

20:31.521 --> 20:35.359
Then, I'll be selling L'Étoile's
first-ever limited-edition essence.

20:35.442 --> 20:38.362
Would you ever consider
working for L'Étoile?

20:39.446 --> 20:40.447
You'd better get in line.

20:43.659 --> 20:45.744
Take it. I still have
some work left to do.

20:52.542 --> 20:53.418
Michelle?

20:53.502 --> 20:57.130
My gosh. You really have no shame, do you?

20:57.214 --> 21:00.884
I send you a gift,
and you don't even give me a single call?

21:00.968 --> 21:03.387
If you knew what I gave up
to answer your call,

21:03.470 --> 21:05.555
you wouldn't be able to say that.

21:05.639 --> 21:08.183
Is the Korean launch coming along well?

21:08.267 --> 21:09.142
Yes.

21:10.269 --> 21:11.561
Don't worry.

21:19.069 --> 21:20.237
Yes?

21:28.495 --> 21:30.205
Can we talk for a moment?

21:48.265 --> 21:51.435
Are you really going
to launch L'Étoile's essence?

21:54.604 --> 21:55.814
You really are doing it.

21:55.897 --> 21:58.900
By the way you're reacting,
I guess I'm pretty good at what I do.

21:58.984 --> 22:00.152
Quit this right now.

22:02.988 --> 22:04.656
Why should I listen to you?

22:09.119 --> 22:12.998
Ruining my life was enough,
don't you think?

22:15.459 --> 22:17.210
Just because I returned to HIT

22:17.294 --> 22:20.297
doesn't mean that what happened
five years ago is all in the past.

22:21.506 --> 22:23.133
Do you really not know

22:24.259 --> 22:25.969
why I wanted

22:26.636 --> 22:27.721
to do that broadcast?

22:27.804 --> 22:30.474
How can you be so shameless?

22:30.557 --> 22:33.060
You were desperate to debut.
Who are you trying to blame?

22:34.936 --> 22:36.688
Everyone is saying

22:36.772 --> 22:39.274
that you're not
the same Dam Ye-jin as before.

22:39.357 --> 22:40.650
But what are we going to do?

22:41.735 --> 22:43.570
You're still the same in my eyes.

22:48.158 --> 22:50.410
Thanks for the advice.

22:51.203 --> 22:52.329
You just made me

22:54.164 --> 22:56.083
really eager to do well this time.

23:34.037 --> 23:38.542
Ms. Dam wants to meet you
at Seoul Municipal Library at 9:00 p.m.

24:31.636 --> 24:33.180
SHE PAINTS HER PICTURE WITHIN MINE

25:00.457 --> 25:02.125
COSMETIC MICROBIOLOGY

25:47.754 --> 25:50.090
Did you block my number, by any chance?

25:50.882 --> 25:51.967
What?

25:56.805 --> 25:58.098
MR. MECHOORI, 2 OUTGOING CALLS

25:58.181 --> 26:00.058
Why weren't you picking up?

26:04.145 --> 26:05.647
I didn't know you called.

26:14.990 --> 26:16.366
Thank you.

26:17.617 --> 26:18.868
I'll see you tomorrow.

26:35.635 --> 26:36.803
Come on…

26:59.034 --> 27:01.077
COSMETIC MICROBIOLOGY

27:02.829 --> 27:05.498
You didn't have to help me this much.

27:06.416 --> 27:07.417
But are you sure

27:07.500 --> 27:09.753
you can read all this
before the broadcast?

27:10.253 --> 27:12.047
You'll barely have time
to learn your script.

27:13.131 --> 27:14.007
My script?

27:14.966 --> 27:17.260
Have you ever seen a Taekwondo athlete

27:17.344 --> 27:19.929
fight during a competition
by doing all the forms in order?

27:20.013 --> 27:21.973
Every second is a battle.
There's no script.

27:24.851 --> 27:26.770
What's wrong? Are you hurt?

27:28.521 --> 27:30.065
I forgot to have dinner.

27:30.148 --> 27:32.025
This is an emergency.

27:48.333 --> 27:49.751
Are you on the run from someone?

27:49.834 --> 27:51.127
Slow down.

27:52.837 --> 27:54.381
It's a habit.

27:54.464 --> 27:56.341
I have about ten meetings a day,

27:56.424 --> 27:58.802
so I just eat food
as if I'm putting in fuel.

27:58.885 --> 28:00.762
No one spends
more than ten minutes filling up.

28:14.067 --> 28:15.276
You're done already?

28:15.360 --> 28:16.277
Yes.

28:19.280 --> 28:20.323
What's that look?

28:20.407 --> 28:23.326
I'm just feeling glad I added
that special clause in the contract.

28:25.078 --> 28:26.830
What do you mean by that?

28:27.455 --> 28:31.376
"Seeing her act, I knew Dam Ye-jin
was full of risks." Is that it?

28:31.459 --> 28:34.045
I didn't know you didn't use scripts.

28:34.129 --> 28:36.756
I thought you were just reciting
what your clients gave you.

28:38.967 --> 28:43.012
I only meant that I'm relieved
I got to learn more about you.

28:47.058 --> 28:49.018
What did you think home shopping hosts do?

28:49.102 --> 28:51.146
It's hard to do
an hour-long show without a script.

28:51.229 --> 28:53.106
I'm sure everyone else will be amazed too.

28:54.065 --> 28:55.692
Then,

28:55.775 --> 28:57.610
should I tell you what my secret is?

29:02.866 --> 29:04.534
You just have to love the products.

29:05.744 --> 29:08.496
If you love them, you just want
to keep talking about them.

29:10.415 --> 29:13.001
What? Do I seem cool?

29:15.128 --> 29:16.212
Just finish your food.

29:16.880 --> 29:19.048
Do you know how hard farmers had to work

29:19.132 --> 29:22.010
to produce the lettuce and tomatoes
in that sandwich?

29:22.552 --> 29:23.553
Fine.

29:29.726 --> 29:31.603
I feel much better now.

29:57.921 --> 29:59.380
You just have to love the products.

29:59.464 --> 30:02.759
If you love them, you just want
to keep talking about them.

30:03.510 --> 30:04.344
Guys.

30:05.845 --> 30:08.765
I got a 97.6%
on the skin barrier improvement test.

30:09.974 --> 30:11.017
I must be a genius.

30:11.100 --> 30:14.103
You can't achieve that
just by using expensive ingredients.

30:14.187 --> 30:15.396
You know that, right?

30:15.480 --> 30:17.982
Come on, it's 97.6%!

30:31.704 --> 30:32.539
Mr. Lee.

30:36.167 --> 30:37.919
This is our storyboard for the shoot.

30:38.002 --> 30:40.463
I thought it'd be nice
if you took a look before the shoot.

30:42.507 --> 30:44.050
I notified you before,

30:44.133 --> 30:46.135
but please be careful when moving around,

30:46.219 --> 30:47.804
especially with your equipment.

30:47.887 --> 30:48.972
Of course.

30:49.055 --> 30:51.474
Don't touch any of the mushrooms directly.

30:51.558 --> 30:54.519
And access to the area
with the original specimen is limited.

30:55.270 --> 30:58.523
Please make sure not to harm
any mushrooms while filming.

30:58.606 --> 30:59.691
Of course, sir.

30:59.774 --> 31:02.235
I'll make sure
to instruct our crew clearly.

31:02.902 --> 31:05.405
Thank you so much
for agreeing to the shoot.

31:23.006 --> 31:24.257
-Ms. Dam.
-Yes?

31:24.340 --> 31:25.842
Here's the final outline.

31:26.718 --> 31:27.552
Sure.

31:30.555 --> 31:33.641
-We marked the revised parts.
-Sorry. Hang on.

31:34.726 --> 31:35.852
Did you forget something?

31:38.062 --> 31:39.898
-I'll hold that.
-Thanks.

31:42.775 --> 31:45.862
I think these will feel
and suit the vibe better today.

31:45.945 --> 31:48.948
They seem to suit our concept better too.

31:56.122 --> 31:57.040
Ms. Dam.

31:57.123 --> 31:58.207
Mr. Seo.

31:58.291 --> 31:59.500
Did you get some sleep?

31:59.584 --> 32:01.085
I couldn't sleep a wink.

32:01.169 --> 32:04.005
Were you nervous?
I told you it's nothing special.

32:04.088 --> 32:05.548
The PR team made a request,

32:05.632 --> 32:07.508
-so let me take your photos.
-Sure.

32:07.592 --> 32:11.763
They say it's for a promotional article
to celebrate the launch in Korea.

32:11.846 --> 32:13.306
Good. Smile.

32:13.389 --> 32:14.557
Stand a little closer.

32:14.641 --> 32:17.143
Good! Amazing! Good!

32:24.108 --> 32:25.276
Awesome.

32:25.360 --> 32:26.194
Très bien!

32:26.277 --> 32:27.862
"Très bien"?

32:29.405 --> 32:32.450
Good, good! Excellent!

32:32.533 --> 32:34.827
Is there anything bothering you?

32:35.495 --> 32:37.747
-Mr. Lee?
-Yes?

32:40.625 --> 32:41.584
No.

32:44.712 --> 32:45.880
It seems like there is.

32:47.757 --> 32:48.591
How are they?

32:48.675 --> 32:51.469
These don't belong
in the business section.

32:51.552 --> 32:54.055
They should be
in the entertainment section!

32:55.765 --> 32:56.683
They look great.

32:57.934 --> 32:58.768
I'm sorry.

33:00.144 --> 33:01.562
Did you have breakfast?

33:01.646 --> 33:02.563
Yes. What about you?

33:02.647 --> 33:04.232
I did too.

33:04.315 --> 33:06.234
You weren't too nervous to eat, were you?

33:06.317 --> 33:07.610
A little bit…

33:10.363 --> 33:11.364
Nice to see you again.

33:14.283 --> 33:15.493
Right.

33:16.285 --> 33:18.663
We meet again.

33:29.007 --> 33:34.220
Just think of this as giving Ms. Dam
a tour of this raw material farm.

33:34.303 --> 33:36.180
No need to be nervous. Just act natural.

33:36.264 --> 33:38.808
Keep introducing the farm
as you slowly walk on.

33:38.891 --> 33:40.059
Good luck!

33:40.143 --> 33:41.060
Let's go, Mr. Seo.

33:41.144 --> 33:44.105
Okay, ready! Action.

33:45.106 --> 33:46.566
-This way, please.
-All right.

33:54.115 --> 33:55.616
Hey, Mechoori.

33:55.700 --> 33:57.285
Don't be nervous.

33:57.368 --> 34:00.788
The camera's faced that way.

34:00.872 --> 34:01.706
The camera angle.

34:01.789 --> 34:04.125
It's not like that.

34:04.208 --> 34:06.335
Don't be silly.
I can tell you're totally scared.

34:07.086 --> 34:08.963
Be careful.
They can still pick up your voice.

34:09.047 --> 34:10.048
Geez.

34:12.425 --> 34:14.427
Okay, your voices
won't be recorded this time.

34:14.510 --> 34:17.221
So just follow the directions I give you.

34:17.305 --> 34:20.433
To the workers in the back,
you can just keep working as normal.

34:20.516 --> 34:23.936
Don't look at the camera
until I say "cut." Keep that in mind.

34:24.020 --> 34:26.147
You two do a handshake first.

34:28.483 --> 34:31.319
No, let's try that again.
You suddenly look so distant.

34:31.402 --> 34:33.446
Give each other a friendly gaze.

34:33.529 --> 34:35.239
Then, shake hands.

34:35.323 --> 34:37.158
How about a bright smile?

34:37.241 --> 34:38.576
Brighter.

34:39.327 --> 34:40.495
Mr. Seo.

34:41.162 --> 34:42.997
Hold on. What's that?

34:43.956 --> 34:45.291
Cut!

34:45.374 --> 34:46.459
Mr. Lee!

34:47.376 --> 34:48.211
Mr. Lee?

34:48.711 --> 34:49.545
Yes?

34:49.629 --> 34:51.464
Don't look at the camera.

34:51.547 --> 34:54.258
You were staring.
Just keep working, Mr. Lee.

34:54.926 --> 34:57.261
What was that? Let's go again.

34:57.345 --> 34:58.596
Mechoori.

34:58.679 --> 35:01.557
The camera's faced this way.

35:04.018 --> 35:07.230
You shouldn't hide though.
Be in the background of the picture.

35:07.313 --> 35:10.066
And by "picture,"
I don't mean like a painting.

35:10.900 --> 35:12.235
All right, I get it.

35:12.985 --> 35:16.197
Okay, Mr. Lee. You just have to harvest
the mushrooms like you always do.

35:16.280 --> 35:18.449
I'll give you some directions as we go.

35:18.533 --> 35:20.118
-Okay.
-Okay?

35:20.201 --> 35:21.369
Let's go.

35:21.452 --> 35:22.370
Ready!

35:23.246 --> 35:24.497
Action.

35:27.458 --> 35:28.918
That was neat. He's good.

35:29.001 --> 35:30.753
Good. Mr. Lee,

35:30.837 --> 35:34.674
how about brushing it off a bit?

35:34.757 --> 35:35.633
All right.

35:36.425 --> 35:39.387
Gosh, we can see the craftsmanship
in those brush strokes.

35:39.470 --> 35:41.139
-There you go.
-That's great, Mr. Lee.

35:41.222 --> 35:44.267
How about harvesting a mushroom up top?

35:49.355 --> 35:51.190
Ms. Dam, what are you doing after this?

35:52.441 --> 35:53.818
This evening?

35:54.944 --> 35:58.072
I have to wrap up and…

35:59.949 --> 36:01.784
Is he crazy?
Those are expensive mushrooms.

36:10.793 --> 36:12.211
What was that?

36:12.295 --> 36:13.462
Did I tell him to crush it?

36:13.546 --> 36:15.089
-No, you didn't.
-I said to harvest it.

36:15.173 --> 36:16.507
No, I just…

36:16.591 --> 36:18.009
Mechoori.

36:18.509 --> 36:20.469
Your face is too frozen.

36:21.262 --> 36:22.972
The camera's just going to
film your hand--

36:23.055 --> 36:26.475
It's not because of the camera!
How many times do I have to tell you?

36:26.559 --> 36:28.686
It's not because of the camera! It's not!

36:29.270 --> 36:31.147
I told you I didn't want to do this.

36:31.772 --> 36:33.065
Just because you do NeoTube…

36:33.149 --> 36:34.483
I know what camera angles are.

36:34.567 --> 36:36.569
I know! I know, okay?

36:36.652 --> 36:39.238
Cut! Why don't we take a short break?

36:39.322 --> 36:41.949
-Hey, go settle things down.
-Yes, let's take a short break.

36:42.033 --> 36:43.117
Just for a moment.

36:43.201 --> 36:44.493
Have some drinks, everyone.

36:44.577 --> 36:46.245
-I brought these sweets.
-There's coffee.

36:46.329 --> 36:47.747
It's coffee. This is amazing.

36:48.789 --> 36:51.167
-Thank you, Mr. Seo.
-You're the best, Mr. Seo.

36:51.250 --> 36:52.627
Thank you for the coffee.

36:52.710 --> 36:55.338
-This is expensive stuff.
-Gosh, this is the good kind.

36:56.172 --> 36:57.173
Thank you, sir.

37:07.808 --> 37:10.186
Gojeuneok Bio is buying!

37:11.020 --> 37:12.271
What's that?

37:15.942 --> 37:17.568
Gosh, the chocolate one looks good.

37:17.652 --> 37:19.445
DRINKS ARE ON GOJEUNEOK BIO!

37:21.572 --> 37:22.406
Sir?

37:22.490 --> 37:23.324
But…

37:24.575 --> 37:27.036
Here's your Mechoori iced tea.

37:27.119 --> 37:29.455
-Thank you.
-Enjoy.

37:29.538 --> 37:31.457
-What did you order?
-Unnie's Power.

37:31.540 --> 37:33.793
In that case,
I'd like a Real Jolly Pongpong.

37:33.876 --> 37:35.836
-Those two.
-Thank you.

37:35.920 --> 37:37.463
-Enjoy.
-Thank you.

37:37.546 --> 37:38.881
THANK YOU FOR YOUR COOPERATION

37:39.632 --> 37:40.633
Thanks for the drinks.

37:41.384 --> 37:43.010
Thank you for this.

37:55.189 --> 37:57.400
-It'll be ready soon, so please wait.
-Okay.

37:57.483 --> 37:58.776
It's Ae-ra.

37:58.859 --> 38:00.945
-One wild dog.
-What wild dog?

38:01.028 --> 38:03.281
-Right behind me.
-Where? Behind you?

38:03.364 --> 38:06.033
Ae-ra's here!

38:10.705 --> 38:12.290
Hello. What would you like?

38:12.373 --> 38:14.834
This is my territory.

38:16.127 --> 38:18.754
I see. I'm sorry, but what is this about?

38:18.838 --> 38:20.965
Right. You should be sorry.

38:21.048 --> 38:24.260
Around here,
everyone drinks only Moon Cafe coffee.

38:24.343 --> 38:26.762
But I stopped work and rushed over
when I heard about this!

38:26.846 --> 38:30.016
I see. I'm a part of this farm's staff.

38:30.099 --> 38:32.435
We have an important shoot today,
so I prepared--

38:32.518 --> 38:33.894
I get it.

38:33.978 --> 38:36.230
So you didn't want coffee
from some country girl

38:36.314 --> 38:37.857
on your important day?

38:37.940 --> 38:39.775
No, it's not that.

38:39.859 --> 38:43.696
This is why I don't talk
to people from Seoul.

38:43.779 --> 38:44.989
You're a bunch of thieves.

38:48.200 --> 38:49.994
I don't think you need to worry.

38:50.077 --> 38:52.204
You'll have many customers
with that kind of beauty.

39:00.004 --> 39:01.505
DEOKPUNG COMMUNITY CENTER

39:01.589 --> 39:02.923
Goodness, good work today!

39:04.342 --> 39:05.676
Hey, Mechoori.

39:09.221 --> 39:10.973
There's a lot of delicious food.

39:12.391 --> 39:13.392
Sit down.

39:14.226 --> 39:17.355
-Ms. Yang.
-Hey, sweetie.

39:18.564 --> 39:21.317
Darling, the food's going to get cold.
Hurry up and sit.

39:23.819 --> 39:26.155
Here. Sit down. Right there.

39:28.157 --> 39:30.242
There's a lot of delicious food!

39:36.540 --> 39:37.792
Mr. Seo, this way.

39:37.875 --> 39:39.960
Move over! What is all this?

39:40.669 --> 39:41.879
-Cockles!
-There's a ton!

39:41.962 --> 39:43.631
-This looks good!
-How did they get these?

39:43.714 --> 39:46.467
Have you tried this before?
It'll be my first time!

39:46.550 --> 39:49.095
What is this? This is insane.

39:51.389 --> 39:54.266
I haven't seen this in a while.
What is all this?

40:06.737 --> 40:09.615
DON'T THOSE TWO LOOK BETTER TOGETHER?

40:09.698 --> 40:11.325
YOU'RE CLUELESS, JONG-IL

40:11.409 --> 40:13.369
THOSE TWO LOOK BETTER TOGETHER

40:13.452 --> 40:14.745
DON'T BE SILLY!

40:14.829 --> 40:15.830
SOMEONE FROM ABROAD

40:15.913 --> 40:17.456
WOULD SUIT MS. DAM BETTER!

40:17.540 --> 40:19.375
WHAT DO YOU KNOW?
YOU CAN'T EVEN SPEAK ENGLISH

40:19.458 --> 40:21.252
GOING BY THEIR LOOKS,
THEY'RE A BETTER MATCH

40:21.335 --> 40:22.586
MR. SEO'S RICH!

40:23.170 --> 40:24.713
AND HE'S A HANDSOME MATCH TOO

40:24.797 --> 40:26.924
CAN YOU HEAR US?
SURE, I CAN

40:27.007 --> 40:28.926
AMAZING
YOU'RE ONE OF US

40:29.009 --> 40:31.387
WHATEVER, I'M WITH FRANCE!
FRANCE IS THE BEST!

40:31.470 --> 40:34.140
YOU HAVE NO LOYALTY
I'M WITH MECHOORI, NO MATTER WHAT!

40:34.223 --> 40:36.016
GEEZ, YOU'RE UNBELIEVABLE

40:36.100 --> 40:37.977
How about a bet then? I'm with France.

40:38.060 --> 40:39.728
Fine, let's do it. I'm with Mechoori.

40:39.812 --> 40:42.565
-It's France!
-It's Mechoori!

40:42.648 --> 40:44.442
-France!
-Mechoori!

40:44.525 --> 40:47.653
Is the food not good?
You're so busy talking.

40:47.736 --> 40:49.363
-It's nothing. Let's eat.
-It's not that.

40:49.447 --> 40:51.407
-Eat up.
-It looks so good.

40:51.490 --> 40:52.616
Thank you for the food.

41:03.377 --> 41:04.378
Oh, dear.

41:18.934 --> 41:19.935
Ooh la la.

41:20.853 --> 41:22.563
Gosh. What should I do?

41:23.397 --> 41:24.815
Ooh la la.

41:32.865 --> 41:34.658
Thank you.

41:34.742 --> 41:35.701
Are you okay?

41:42.625 --> 41:45.336
I'm sure this will be okay for you to eat.

41:45.419 --> 41:48.047
It's fine. You won't have
much to eat on your side then.

41:48.130 --> 41:49.673
There's a lot. Eat up.

41:53.260 --> 41:54.261
Are you okay?

42:01.185 --> 42:03.395
-Goodness!
-Gosh, they must be having a blast!

42:03.479 --> 42:05.940
-What a scene!
-Hey, cheers!

42:06.023 --> 42:07.900
Excuse us. Hello.

42:07.983 --> 42:09.318
This looks so delicious.

42:10.361 --> 42:12.363
-Mind if I sit here?
-Thank you for the food.

42:12.446 --> 42:13.322
Go ahead.

42:13.405 --> 42:16.116
That table's pretty entertaining too.

42:16.200 --> 42:17.576
Let's see what happens.

42:17.660 --> 42:19.453
-Cheers.
-Cheers!

42:20.579 --> 42:21.455
This soup's great.

42:22.039 --> 42:23.165
It's nice and rich.

42:45.271 --> 42:46.689
You should try this too, Ms. Moon.

42:47.356 --> 42:48.816
The perilla leaves are…

42:52.653 --> 42:55.781
Just give it to me. I'll eat it.

42:58.325 --> 42:59.159
What the heck?

43:02.329 --> 43:03.330
There aren't any left.

43:04.540 --> 43:05.833
Here.

43:05.916 --> 43:07.167
Have this.

43:07.751 --> 43:09.837
You didn't get to try any.

43:15.801 --> 43:17.219
-Eat.
-Right.

43:18.095 --> 43:20.097
These other dishes are good too.

43:20.180 --> 43:25.019
Gosh, Kwang-mo's cheeks are bright red!

43:25.769 --> 43:29.607
Our Kwang-mo
must have finally found new love.

43:29.690 --> 43:32.151
I guess so. My goodness.

43:32.234 --> 43:34.862
Gosh, that's so nice to see.

43:37.031 --> 43:37.948
Jung-muk!

43:38.949 --> 43:39.825
Jung-muk.

43:40.618 --> 43:42.453
Can you check my heart?

43:43.746 --> 43:44.705
My heart…

43:45.414 --> 43:48.208
should only be beating for Ae-ra.

43:49.209 --> 43:51.128
It must be broken.

43:51.211 --> 43:52.921
This doesn't make sense!

43:53.672 --> 43:55.924
Why was it suddenly pounding?

43:56.008 --> 43:57.509
Why?

43:57.593 --> 44:00.512
HELP SAVE YOUR FRIEND, JUNG-MUK!

44:01.639 --> 44:04.016
You did a great job today, Mr. Seo.

44:04.099 --> 44:06.143
You did better than I thought.

44:06.226 --> 44:07.936
It was pretty fun.

44:08.020 --> 44:10.022
And I think it'll keep getting more fun.

44:14.068 --> 44:18.489
I can't believe I'm actually saying
that work is going to be fun.

44:19.865 --> 44:21.825
It's all thanks to you.

44:21.909 --> 44:26.080
I wouldn't have experienced this sense
of achievement if it weren't for you.

44:26.664 --> 44:29.249
The broadcast hasn't
even happened yet, Mr. Seo.

44:30.876 --> 44:33.003
You must be tired.
You should head in and rest.

44:33.796 --> 44:34.922
Well, I…

44:35.881 --> 44:37.675
I'm going to do more research

44:37.758 --> 44:41.387
on the growing conditions
and characteristics of the mushrooms.

44:41.470 --> 44:43.931
Our customers are keen on such details.

44:45.182 --> 44:47.810
I'm curious about such details as well.

44:53.565 --> 44:54.858
-Hello?
-Mr. Seo.

44:54.942 --> 44:58.028
It's almost time
for your video call with the chairman.

44:58.112 --> 44:59.029
All right.

45:02.074 --> 45:03.784
I have to go.

45:04.326 --> 45:05.786
Give me a call if you need anything.

45:06.537 --> 45:07.621
Sure.

45:19.341 --> 45:20.342
What are you doing?

45:22.010 --> 45:23.720
I wanted to help you.

45:31.019 --> 45:32.396
Take off your gloves

45:33.772 --> 45:35.107
and take this.

45:43.407 --> 45:45.242
Thanks for letting us do the shoot here.

45:45.325 --> 45:47.077
It must have been a difficult decision.

45:47.161 --> 45:50.038
Yes, and today will be
the first and last shoot here.

45:52.791 --> 45:54.585
Was it that uncomfortable for you?

45:55.419 --> 45:58.130
Then, why did you say yes
instead of refusing?

45:58.630 --> 45:59.882
It was because of you, Ms. Dam.

46:10.142 --> 46:11.977
You keep pushing ahead until you succeed,

46:12.060 --> 46:12.895
Ms. Dam.

46:19.943 --> 46:20.819
Well…

46:23.405 --> 46:25.616
When and where should we meet tomorrow?

46:26.366 --> 46:27.784
You decide and tell me.

46:27.868 --> 46:30.746
Starting tomorrow,
I'm going to be busy for a while.

46:30.829 --> 46:32.706
Is it okay to meet in Seoul?

46:32.789 --> 46:33.957
It doesn't matter.

46:34.041 --> 46:35.959
We can meet in front of your house too.

46:37.461 --> 46:39.129
You'd come all the way to my house?

46:41.507 --> 46:42.508
Yes.

46:47.679 --> 46:48.597
All right.

46:49.556 --> 46:51.767
Then, I'll see you at my house
at 9:00 p.m. tomorrow.

46:52.392 --> 46:53.644
I mean, in front of my house.

47:09.535 --> 47:10.786
PREMIUM GRADE

47:11.370 --> 47:13.038
GOJEUNEOK BIO

47:27.261 --> 47:28.262
GOJEUNEOK BIO

47:28.345 --> 47:29.471
Would this be good enough?

47:35.435 --> 47:39.439
So from now on, you'll make them
with these new pumps?

47:39.523 --> 47:41.775
Just the ones launching in Korea for now.

47:41.858 --> 47:43.652
If market response is good,

47:43.735 --> 47:46.697
we'll formally propose
a design renewal to headquarters.

47:48.991 --> 47:51.076
-The camera angle will be important here.
-Yes?

47:54.955 --> 47:57.874
Here's the final package
that just passed the drop test!

47:59.835 --> 48:01.753
-Come on!
-Okay! I haven't opened it yet.

48:02.963 --> 48:04.756
Hey, they look so pretty.

48:04.840 --> 48:06.883
We could just use these as decor.

48:06.967 --> 48:09.553
I can't wait to do
the broadcast for these.

48:09.636 --> 48:11.263
-This is awesome.
-The scent is nice too.

48:13.307 --> 48:15.142
Great. There's no smell
of mushrooms at all.

48:17.185 --> 48:18.395
Stop, Ye-jin.

48:18.478 --> 48:20.105
-What?
-You're doing it again.

48:20.188 --> 48:21.481
My goodness.

48:21.565 --> 48:23.108
Our meticulous QA team,

48:23.191 --> 48:24.943
our sharp Ms. Eom,

48:25.027 --> 48:28.822
and even me, the smart merchandiser,
are all checking the product.

48:28.905 --> 48:30.407
Why are you so worried?

48:31.074 --> 48:32.492
I don't know.

48:35.037 --> 48:38.457
Everything's perfect,
so it's making me even more anxious.

48:56.725 --> 48:58.685
L'ÉTOILE E
AUGUST 9, NO. 4

49:00.771 --> 49:04.024
Let's prepare inserts
for various skin types.

49:04.107 --> 49:06.818
And for the before and after too.
Okay, bye.

49:07.736 --> 49:11.239
Gosh, thanks for coming all the way here.

49:17.245 --> 49:19.122
-I--
-Hey, Mr. Hwang.

49:19.790 --> 49:20.957
Right. Hang on.

49:21.041 --> 49:22.501
I'll get going.

49:24.503 --> 49:27.631
The human application test results
on our display panel…

49:49.069 --> 49:50.112
Thank you.

50:12.092 --> 50:13.301
Thank you.

50:27.774 --> 50:29.526
Mr. Mechoori.

50:31.319 --> 50:33.613
I took a taxi today.

50:37.951 --> 50:39.077
Thank you.

51:20.035 --> 51:21.953
Could you put that in here?

51:25.457 --> 51:26.792
ANTACID

51:33.298 --> 51:34.716
My meds…

51:37.636 --> 51:38.553
Goodness.

51:39.137 --> 51:40.013
Thank you.

51:59.074 --> 52:01.618
Is HIT the Ministry of Food
and Drug Safety or something?

52:01.701 --> 52:02.702
Are you the FDA?

52:02.786 --> 52:05.121
The broadcast is tomorrow.

52:05.205 --> 52:08.458
How long are you going to
keep checking the numbers for?

52:08.542 --> 52:10.460
This is really the last time.

52:10.544 --> 52:12.212
I'll call you one last time tonight.

52:12.295 --> 52:13.171
Geez!

52:33.775 --> 52:34.860
Thank you.

52:36.403 --> 52:37.237
Thank you.

52:38.697 --> 52:39.698
Thank you.

52:55.046 --> 52:56.256
CHAMOMILE TEA

53:17.903 --> 53:19.195
COFFEE CANDY

53:19.279 --> 53:21.197
ENERGY BOOSTER

53:28.830 --> 53:29.664
Ms. Dam.

53:29.748 --> 53:30.707
ENERGY GUM

53:34.419 --> 53:36.379
Are you planning to not sleep forever?

53:38.423 --> 53:40.008
Well, I…

53:51.728 --> 53:56.232
You sure do exert your authority
in a very sweet way.

53:56.316 --> 53:57.567
I'm protecting our best player.

53:59.027 --> 54:00.737
Just wait until the broadcast is over…

54:01.905 --> 54:05.450
Oh, right. I forgot to contact you.

54:05.533 --> 54:06.451
Well,

54:07.285 --> 54:10.080
I don't need my meds today.

54:10.830 --> 54:12.082
I'm staying up all night.

54:20.215 --> 54:21.049
Follow me.

54:22.008 --> 54:22.884
To where?

54:23.593 --> 54:24.844
Are you angry?

54:26.680 --> 54:28.848
Mr. Mechoori, I wasn't staying up
these past few days.

54:28.932 --> 54:31.101
Today is just an important day.

54:31.851 --> 54:35.105
But you haven't told me where we're going.

54:42.946 --> 54:44.406
What is this place?

54:46.157 --> 54:48.702
It's near your house.

54:48.785 --> 54:51.204
Right…

54:52.747 --> 54:55.083
I didn't even know
there was a place like this.

55:15.979 --> 55:18.398
Why aren't you going to sleep tonight?

55:19.190 --> 55:20.942
I still have something to check.

55:21.860 --> 55:24.362
I can't sleep even with my meds
if something's bothering me.

55:25.447 --> 55:27.365
The broadcast is tomorrow.

55:27.449 --> 55:28.700
Is there still more to check?

55:29.325 --> 55:30.577
There's one thing left.

55:32.078 --> 55:33.455
Me.

55:36.166 --> 55:37.751
I'm sure you know the feeling.

55:38.501 --> 55:40.170
You told me last time

55:40.253 --> 55:42.380
that you keep working
until you've done enough.

55:45.175 --> 55:46.176
But…

55:46.676 --> 55:50.263
how do you know when you've done enough?

55:52.265 --> 55:55.268
I'm sure you know that better than I do.

55:56.811 --> 55:58.271
Me?

55:58.354 --> 56:00.899
You know yourself the best.

56:01.858 --> 56:02.859
And you…

56:04.152 --> 56:05.528
have done well so far.

56:10.116 --> 56:12.410
So believe in yourself tomorrow.

56:54.077 --> 56:58.540
ADD CONTACTS
DAM YE-JIN

57:03.294 --> 57:06.089
DAM YE-JIN

57:08.508 --> 57:12.679
Dam Ye-jin, are you sure
you've done the best you can?

57:12.762 --> 57:14.764
I'm not sure.

57:21.855 --> 57:24.691
I have to keep going
until I find the answer.

57:53.845 --> 57:57.140
DAM YE-JIN'S ONLY1
L'ÉTOILE LA FIN ESSENCE

57:58.433 --> 58:01.978
ONLY ON HIT
FULL-SCALE LAUNCH TODAY

58:07.859 --> 58:10.904
I want to gift a necklace
so they can wear it for an important show.

58:10.987 --> 58:11.821
What would be nice?

58:11.905 --> 58:13.781
Since it's a gift,

58:13.865 --> 58:17.243
wouldn't it be more meaningful
for you to select it yourself?

58:18.161 --> 58:21.080
We're not that close yet.

58:21.164 --> 58:24.959
Instead of my choice, could you pick one
that women would find pretty?

58:25.543 --> 58:29.464
All right. Well, in my opinion…

58:30.882 --> 58:32.050
How about this one?

58:32.133 --> 58:34.969
This is the most popular item
in our shop these days.

58:35.803 --> 58:38.806
L'ÉTOILE E
AUGUST 16, NO. 1

59:07.627 --> 59:09.504
L'ÉTOILE E
AUGUST 9, NO. 1

59:12.715 --> 59:14.425
L'ÉTOILE E
AUGUST 9, NO. 2

59:18.805 --> 59:20.223
Mu-won, I…

59:21.808 --> 59:23.184
What? What's wrong?

59:24.102 --> 59:24.936
What is it?

59:29.524 --> 59:31.526
MICROBIAL TESTING AND EXPECTED RESULTS

59:31.609 --> 59:35.113
I think this one looks nice and clean.

59:35.196 --> 59:36.614
-Good.
-Okay.

59:36.698 --> 59:39.033
-Then, I'll try this on.
-Okay.

59:42.787 --> 59:44.372
I need to go to HIT.

59:44.455 --> 59:47.166
Hey, what are you going to do
if you go to HIT?

59:47.250 --> 59:48.793
The live broadcast is in an hour.

59:48.876 --> 59:50.920
That's why I have to go and stop them.

59:51.004 --> 59:54.507
In an hour, the essence
will be sold across the country.

59:54.591 --> 59:56.884
Even if L'Étoile issues a full recall,

59:56.968 --> 59:58.678
they won't be able
to retrieve all of them.

59:58.761 --> 01:00:00.930
-Hae-seok, just calm down.
-Mu-won.

01:00:02.765 --> 01:00:06.394
This could lead
to another case like Som-yi.

01:00:07.979 --> 01:00:09.063
Go on.

01:00:09.647 --> 01:00:10.732
I'll contact L'Étoile.

01:00:45.183 --> 01:00:46.601
GOJEUNEOK BIO CEO KANG MU-WON

01:00:49.062 --> 01:00:50.104
Hello?

01:00:52.190 --> 01:00:54.525
Microbes were detected?

01:01:13.878 --> 01:01:16.130
DAM YE-JIN'S ONLY1
L'ÉTOILE LA FIN ESSENCE

01:01:16.214 --> 01:01:17.215
STUDIO C

01:01:22.470 --> 01:01:25.139
-Where's Studio C?
-It's on the 8th floor.

01:01:25.223 --> 01:01:27.392
Wait… Hold on!

01:01:47.954 --> 01:01:50.623
Excuse me.
Where's Dam Ye-jin's green room?

01:01:50.707 --> 01:01:53.334
If you go down and turn right,
it'll be there.

01:01:57.130 --> 01:01:58.089
Ms. Dam!

01:02:01.050 --> 01:02:02.343
Mr. Mechoori?

01:02:03.886 --> 01:02:06.639
Microbes were detected in the essence.

01:02:06.723 --> 01:02:07.724
What?

01:02:08.725 --> 01:02:10.601
No, that can't be.

01:02:10.685 --> 01:02:12.687
I checked dozens of times.

01:02:12.770 --> 01:02:15.440
These are the test results
from an hour ago.

01:02:15.523 --> 01:02:18.025
It's 360 CFU per gram.

01:02:18.109 --> 01:02:20.027
That's much lower than the MFDS limit.

01:02:20.111 --> 01:02:23.239
I know there's no issue
if you look at the numbers now.

01:02:23.322 --> 01:02:24.574
But…

01:02:27.577 --> 01:02:29.662
Compare them
with the numbers from three days ago.

01:02:30.496 --> 01:02:34.500
At this growth rate,
we can't even be sure about tomorrow.

01:02:34.584 --> 01:02:38.004
We have to stop today's broadcast.

01:02:43.718 --> 01:02:45.553
Ms. Dam, stand by.

01:02:51.267 --> 01:02:52.643
Ms. Dam.

01:02:57.482 --> 01:02:59.358
EXPECTED NUMBER
28TH DAY

01:03:07.408 --> 01:03:08.951
Ms. Dam.

01:03:09.952 --> 01:03:11.120
Are you

01:03:11.871 --> 01:03:13.748
seriously going to sell…

01:03:15.291 --> 01:03:16.876
a compromised product?

01:03:23.007 --> 01:03:25.343
I promised to meet
our customers at this hour.

01:03:45.238 --> 01:03:47.281
FIRST EVER LAUNCH IN KOREA
TODAY, AUGUST 16

01:04:21.357 --> 01:04:23.359
-Who are you?
-What are you doing?

01:04:23.442 --> 01:04:24.944
I need to speak briefly with Ms. Dam.

01:04:25.027 --> 01:04:26.153
-We're live--
-It's urgent!

01:04:32.285 --> 01:04:33.452
Dam Ye-jin!

01:04:33.536 --> 01:04:35.121
Ms. Dam!

01:04:35.705 --> 01:04:36.873
You can't do the broadcast!

01:04:36.956 --> 01:04:38.124
You can't go in!

01:04:41.002 --> 01:04:43.004
Please. Dam Ye-jin…

01:04:43.087 --> 01:04:45.214
I just need one moment. Please.

01:04:45.298 --> 01:04:47.008
She can't do the broadcast!

01:04:47.091 --> 01:04:48.009
Ms. Dam!

01:05:00.062 --> 01:05:02.064
Hello, I'm Dam Ye-jin.

01:05:02.148 --> 01:05:05.860
I'd like to sincerely thank everyone
who has shown such great interest

01:05:05.943 --> 01:05:09.488
in the launch
of L'Étoile's La Fin Essence.

01:05:10.072 --> 01:05:12.116
But before we begin the broadcast,

01:05:12.199 --> 01:05:14.118
I'd like to apologize.

01:05:18.372 --> 01:05:19.957
On tonight's show,

01:05:20.041 --> 01:05:22.168
we will not be selling the essence.

01:05:25.671 --> 01:05:27.590
SOLD OUT ON YOU

01:05:57.787 --> 01:06:00.790
Did she just blow a prime time slot
worth millions of won per minute?

01:06:00.873 --> 01:06:03.918
So you're saying that host did this
without even discussing it with you?

01:06:04.001 --> 01:06:06.253
Don't lay a hand on Dam Ye-jin.

01:06:07.296 --> 01:06:09.840
It seems Dam Ye-jin's going to
end up taking all the blame.

01:06:09.924 --> 01:06:12.551
"We sell value with sincerity."

01:06:12.635 --> 01:06:15.805
I made the choice
to keep the promise that HIT made.

01:06:15.888 --> 01:06:19.767
Effective today, HIT will be terminating
its contract with you.

01:06:19.850 --> 01:06:21.268
Ms. Dam!

01:06:21.352 --> 01:06:22.728
Mom.

01:06:22.812 --> 01:06:24.271
Are you okay?

01:06:24.355 --> 01:06:26.148
Mechoori…

01:06:26.232 --> 01:06:28.442
Come with me. Please.

01:06:33.906 --> 01:06:35.908
Subtitle translation by: Juyoung Park
